      "description": "`previous_exit` rides on `app.launched` and says how the run *before* this one ended, so a spike here lags the build that caused it by one launch.\n\n**Always segment by platform before reading a rate.** Android reads historical exit reasons (API 30+, older devices report `unknown`); iOS derives it from MetricKit, which is day-granular and up to 24h late, so most iOS launches say `unknown` and will drag any blended rate toward it.",
